HOME SHOPPING BROADCAST
PARTNERSHIP AGREEMENT

17
00:02:08,024 --> 00:02:10,360
"As L'Étoile's La Fin Essence

18
00:02:10,443 --> 00:02:12,820
will be launched through a live broadcast,

19
00:02:12,904 --> 00:02:15,156
