21
00:02:18,785 --> 00:02:22,538
"If any action is required, both parties
must work together to resolve the matter."

22
00:02:22,622 --> 00:02:25,583
Yes. One pack per day.

23
00:02:25,667 --> 00:02:28,795
That's the condition I'm requesting
for our contract renewal.

24
00:02:29,629 --> 00:02:30,713
Then…

25
00:02:31,381 --> 00:02:33,841
this means you're going to
supply the raw material?

26
00:02:33,925 --> 00:02:36,386
Yes, if both you and L'Étoile
accept my condition.

27
00:02:36,469 --> 00:02:38,388
Of course, we will!

28
00:02:38,471 --> 00:02:39,847
Of course!

29
