35
00:03:12,338 --> 00:03:13,965
Yes.

36
00:03:14,048 --> 00:03:15,633
Oh, right.

37
00:03:15,717 --> 00:03:19,721
I can take a cab, so don't worry.
You can head home now.

38
00:03:21,806 --> 00:03:23,307
Take care.

39
