Wait!

40
00:03:33,192 --> 00:03:34,485
I…

41
00:03:35,194 --> 00:03:36,320
187-2 SEONGCHO-DONG

42
00:03:36,404 --> 00:03:38,114
DEOKCHEON REST AREA
TO 187-2 SEONGCHO-DONG

43
00:03:38,197 --> 00:03:39,991
ESTIMATED TIME
2 HOURS 20 MINUTES

44
