Give it. I'll add it then.

81
00:06:02,133 --> 00:06:04,385
No, we already made the deal,
so it's over.

82
00:06:04,468 --> 00:06:06,137
-Let me just add it.
-Don't be so cheap.

83
00:06:06,220 --> 00:06:08,139
-Give it to me.
-Focus on driving.

84
