This is awful.

122
00:08:57,433 --> 00:08:58,684
Oh, right!

123
00:09:18,704 --> 00:09:19,955
Sung-mi.

124
00:09:20,665 --> 00:09:22,458
How long have you been out here?

125
00:09:22,541 --> 00:09:25,294
You little…

126
00:09:25,378 --> 00:09:27,213
Where the hell have you been?

127
00:09:31,509 --> 00:09:33,052
For crying out loud.

128
00:09:34,261 --> 00:09:36,347
Have you lost your mind?

129
00:09:36,430 --> 00:09:38,724
You think whatever I say
is a joke, don't you?

130
00:09:38,808 --> 00:09:40,476
I clearly told you earlier

131
00:09:40,559 --> 00:09:42,603
