but you weren't home and wouldn't pick up!

133
00:09:46,399 --> 00:09:48,067
Where on earth did you go?

134
00:09:48,150 --> 00:09:50,236
Why are you making such a fuss?

135
00:09:50,820 --> 00:09:52,863
I was away for just a few hours…

136
00:09:53,781 --> 00:09:55,324
I'm worried you'll burn out.

137
00:09:55,908 --> 00:09:57,284
Hey. They say even phones

138
00:09:57,368 --> 00:10:00,037
