144
00:10:14,802 --> 00:10:16,637
-What?
-We'll go to work together tomorrow.

145
00:10:16,721 --> 00:10:19,473
It was my fault for leaving you alone.

146
00:10:19,557 --> 00:10:20,683
I'm the one to blame.

147
00:10:20,766 --> 00:10:22,435
I'm totally fine though.

148
00:10:22,518 --> 00:10:23,561
Shut up!

149
00:10:25,062 --> 00:10:26,063
Yes, ma'am.

150
00:11:55,611 --> 00:11:56,820
Sung-mi.

151
00:11:58,531 --> 00:12:01,992
I experienced something really strange.

152
00:12:06,288 --> 00:12:08,916
Don't you have any upbeat music?

153
00:12:08,999 --> 00:12:11,377
This is music that helps plants relax.

154
00:12:15,714 --> 00:12:17,841
Is this a dentist's office or what?

155
00:12:44,702 --> 00:12:46,036
I felt relaxed.

156
00:12:46,745 --> 00:12:49,373
Was it because of the music?

157
00:12:50,749 --> 00:12:52,209
Or…

158
