I must be out of my mind.

161
00:13:08,309 --> 00:13:10,352
I must be crazy.

162
00:13:12,980 --> 00:13:14,982
GOJEUNEOK BIO

163
00:13:21,864 --> 00:13:23,198
-Oh, my gosh!
-Oh, my gosh!

164
00:13:23,782 --> 00:13:25,284
