All right. Well, in my opinion…

788
00:58:30,987 --> 00:58:32,155
How about this one?

789
00:58:32,238 --> 00:58:35,074
This is the most popular item
in our shop these days.

790
00:58:35,908 --> 00:58:38,911
L'ÉTOILE E
AUGUST 16, NO. 1

791
00:59:07,732 --> 00:59:09,609
L'ÉTOILE E
AUGUST 9, NO. 1

792
00:59:12,820 --> 00:59:14,530
L'ÉTOILE E
AUGUST 9, NO. 2

793
00:59:18,910 --> 00:59:20,328
Mu-won, I…

794
00:59:21,913 --> 00:59:23,289
What? What's wrong?

795
00:59:24,207 --> 00:59:25,041
What is it?

796
00:59:29,629 --> 00:59:31,631
MICROBIAL TESTING AND EXPECTED RESULTS

797
00:59:31,714 --> 00:59:35,218
I think this one looks nice and clean.

798
00:59:35,301 --> 00:59:36,719
-Good.
-Okay.

799
00:59:36,803 --> 00:59:39,138
-Then, I'll try this on.
-Okay.

800
00:59:42,892 --> 00:59:44,477
I need to go to HIT.

801
00:59:44,560 --> 00:59:47,271
Hey, what are you going to do
if you go to HIT?

802
00:59:47,355 --> 00:59:48,898
The live broadcast is in an hour.

803
00:59:48,981 --> 00:59:51,025
That's why I have to go and stop them.

804
00:59:51,109 --> 00:59:54,612
In an hour, the essence
will be sold across the country.

805
00:59:54,696 --> 00:59:56,989
Even if L'Étoile issues a full recall,

806
00:59:57,073 --> 00:59:58,783
they won't be able
to retrieve all of them.

807
00:59:58,866 --> 01:00:01,035
-Hae-seok, just calm down.
-Mu-won.

808
01:00:02,870 --> 01:00:06,499
This could lead
to another case like Som-yi.

809
01:00:08,084 --> 01:00:09,168
Go on.

810
01:00:09,752 --> 01:00:10,837
I'll contact L'Étoile.

811
01:00:45,288 --> 01:00:46,706
GOJEUNEOK BIO CEO KANG MU-WON

812
01:00:49,167 --> 01:00:50,209
Hello?

813
01:00:52,295 --> 01:00:54,630
Microbes were detected?

814
01:01:13,983 --> 01:01:16,235
DAM YE-JIN'S ONLY1
L'ÉTOILE LA FIN ESSENCE

815
01:01:16,319 --> 01:01:17,320
STUDIO C

816
01:01:22,575 --> 01:01:25,244
-Where's Studio C?
-It's on the 8th floor.

817
01:01:25,328 --> 01:01:27,497
Wait… Hold on!

818
01:01:48,059 --> 01:01:50,728
Excuse me.
Where's Dam Ye-jin's green room?

819
01:01:50,812 --> 01:01:53,439
If you go down and turn right,
it'll be there.

820
01:01:57,235 --> 01:01:58,194
Ms. Dam!

821
01:02:01,155 --> 01:02:02,448
Mr. Mechoori?

822
01:02:03,991 --> 01:02:06,744
Microbes were detected in the essence.

823
01:02:06,828 --> 01:02:07,829
What?

824
01:02:08,830 --> 01:02:10,706
No, that can't be.

825
01:02:10,790 --> 01:02:12,792
I checked dozens of times.

826
01:02:12,875 --> 01:02:15,545
These are the test results
from an hour ago.

827
01:02:15,628 --> 01:02:18,130
It's 360 CFU per gram.

828
01:02:18,214 --> 01:02:20,132
That's much lower than the MFDS limit.

829
01:02:20,216 --> 01:02:23,344
I know there's no issue
if you look at the numbers now.

830
01:02:23,427 --> 01:02:24,679
But…

831
01:02:27,682 --> 01:02:29,767
Compare them
with the numbers from three days ago.

832
01:02:30,601 --> 01:02:34,605
At this growth rate,
we can't even be sure about tomorrow.

833
01:02:34,689 --> 01:02:38,109
We have to stop today's broadcast.

834
01:02:43,823 --> 01:02:45,658
Ms. Dam, stand by.

835
01:02:51,372 --> 01:02:52,748
Ms. Dam.

836
01:02:57,587 --> 01:02:59,463
EXPECTED NUMBER
28TH DAY

837
01:03:07,513 --> 01:03:09,056
Ms. Dam.

838
01:03:10,057 --> 01:03:11,225
Are you

839
01:03:11,976 --> 01:03:13,853
seriously going to sell…

840
01:03:15,396 --> 01:03:16,981
a compromised product?

841
01:03:23,112 --> 01:03:25,448
I promised to meet
our customers at this hour.

842
01:03:45,343 --> 01:03:47,386
FIRST EVER LAUNCH IN KOREA
TODAY, AUGUST 16

843
01:04:21,462 --> 01:04:23,464
-Who are you?
-What are you doing?

844
01:04:23,547 --> 01:04:25,049
I need to speak briefly with Ms. Dam.

845
01:04:25,132 --> 01:04:26,258
-We're live--
-It's urgent!

846
01:04:32,390 --> 01:04:33,557
Dam Ye-jin!

847
01:04:33,641 --> 01:04:35,226
Ms. Dam!

848
01:04:35,810 --> 01:04:36,978
You can't do the broadcast!

849
01:04:37,061 --> 01:04:38,229
You can't go in!

850
01:04:41,107 --> 01:04:43,109
Please. Dam Ye-jin…

851
01:04:43,192 --> 01:04:45,319
I just need one moment. Please.

852
01:04:45,403 --> 01:04:47,113
She can't do the broadcast!

853
01:04:47,196 --> 01:04:48,114
Ms. Dam!

854
01:05:00,167 --> 01:05:02,169
Hello, I'm Dam Ye-jin.

855
01:05:02,253 --> 01:05:05,965
I'd like to sincerely thank everyone
who has shown such great interest

856
01:05:06,048 --> 01:05:09,593
in the launch
of L'Étoile's La Fin Essence.

857
01:05:10,177 --> 01:05:12,221
But before we begin the broadcast,

858
01:05:12,304 --> 01:05:14,223
I'd like to apologize.

859
01:05:18,477 --> 01:05:20,062
On tonight's show,

860
01:05:20,146 --> 01:05:22,273
we will not be selling the essence.

861
01:05:25,776 --> 01:05:27,695
SOLD OUT ON YOU

862
01:05:57,892 --> 01:06:00,895
<i>Did she just blow a prime time slot</i>
<i>worth millions of won per minute?</i>

863
01:06:00,978 --> 01:06:04,023
So you're saying that host did this
without even discussing it with you?

864
01:06:04,106 --> 01:06:06,358
<i>Don't lay a hand on Dam Ye-jin.</i>

865
01:06:07,401 --> 01:06:09,945
<i>It seems Dam Ye-jin's going to</i>
<i>end up taking all the blame.</i>

866
01:06:10,029 --> 01:06:12,656
"We sell value with sincerity."

867
01:06:12,740 --> 01:06:15,910
<i>I made the choice</i>
<i>to keep the promise that HIT made.</i>

868
01:06:15,993 --> 01:06:19,872
<i>Effective today, HIT will be terminating</i>
<i>its contract with you.</i>

869
01:06:19,955 --> 01:06:21,373
<i>Ms. Dam!</i>

870
01:06:21,457 --> 01:06:22,833
<i>Mom.</i>

871
01:06:22,917 --> 01:06:24,376
<i>Are you okay?</i>

872
01:06:24,460 --> 01:06:26,253
<i>Mechoori…</i>

873
01:06:26,337 --> 01:06:28,547
<i>Come with me. Please.</i>

874
01:06:34,011 --> 01:06:36,013
Subtitle translation by: Juyoung Park

